 water distribution system.","source":"U.S. EPA, mandatory health effects language \u2014 Revised Total Coliform Rule","who":"A warning sign rather than a harm in itself.","kind":"contaminant","name":"Revised Total Coliform Rule"},"Interim Enhanced Surface Water Treatment Rule":{"kind":"rule","name":"Interim Enhanced Surface Water Treatment Rule","plain":"A stricter version of the surface water treatment requirements, aimed particularly at Cryptosporidium.","effect":null,"source":null,"who":null},"Lead and Copper Rule":{"kind":"rule","name":"Lead and Copper Rule","plain":"The rule governing lead and copper monitoring and corrosion control. A violation is often procedural \u2014 a missed sampling round or a late report.","effect":null,"source":null,"who":null}}}